summary:
  A pause inside a list stops the player and then clears its source.

history:
  Measured on Qt 6.12 with FFmpeg 9: stop() on a list whose reader has
  run out of segments returns, and then the event loop stands until the list
  grows. With the source cleared first the player lets go in 4 to 13 ms,
  however its reader stands.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
              else { root._tsPaused = true; alarmEngine.standDown(); playMusic.source = ""; playMusic.stop(); }

replace:
              else { root._tsPaused = true; alarmEngine.standDown(); playMusic.stop(); playMusic.source = ""; }

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_a_pause_inside_the_sliding_buffer_lets_the_player_go_source_first.
  Line-neutral.
